graph TD
    subgraph Execution ["Execution Pipeline"]
        Pending((PENDING))
        Processing((PROCESSING))
    end

    subgraph Governance ["Observatory & Compliance Lifecycle"]
        Staged((STAGED))
        Published((PUBLISHED))
    end

    subgraph FaultHandling ["Error Recovery & Deadlock"]
        Failed((FAILED))
        Cancelled((CANCELLED))
    end

    Deleted([DELETED])

    %% Pipeline Flow
    Pending --> |Worker picks up job| Processing
    Processing --> |Metrics consolidated| Staged

    %% Retry & Failure Flow
    Processing --> |Transient error| Failed
    Failed --> |Retry attempt <= 3| Processing
    Failed --> |Max retries reached| Deleted

    %% Cancellation Flow
    Processing --> |User abort| Cancelled
    Cancelled --> |Immediate purge| Deleted

    %% Active Governance Flow
    Staged --> |Publish| Published
    Published --> |"Unpublish<br/>(if unfrozen)"| Staged
    Published --> |"Delete (if unfrozen)"| Deleted
    Staged --> |Discard / Delete| Deleted

    %% Quarterly Governance (Cron / Batch)
    Published --> |"Freeze snapshot<br/>(quarter-end)"| Published
    Staged -.-> |Quarter-end cleanup| Deleted